<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand notes average yield 11.35 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand notes average yield 11.35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Friday announced the following result of its weekly notes auction:</p>
<p> MATURITY  TENDER AMT   ALLOTED AMT    AVG YIELD    RANGE</p>
<p>	     (MLNS BAHT)  (MLNS BAHT)</p>
<p>    28 days     4,910	 2,000	   11.35    10.50-11.75</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-652-0642</p>
</text>
